#. ja: 第二次復興用のカイマン
#. de: Genist-Kaiman
#. fr: caïman de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' caimans
#. column 8: Though the skybuilders are often willing to take in scalekin captured alive, they have specifically requested that any caiman presented be certifiably dead before being brought to the Firmament. Given its resemblance to a wingless dragon, the less sensible members of the populace may fear a second Dragonsong War is upon them.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Caiman
msgctxt "Item:30001:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' caiman"
msgstr "кайман для небесных строителей II"

#. de: Genist-Kaimane
#. fr: caïmans de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 0: grade 2 skybuilders' caiman
#. column 8: Though the skybuilders are often willing to take in scalekin captured alive, they have specifically requested that any caiman presented be certifiably dead before being brought to the Firmament. Given its resemblance to a wingless dragon, the less sensible members of the populace may fear a second Dragonsong War is upon them.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Caiman
msgctxt "Item:30001:0:2"
msgid "grade 2 skybuilders' caimans"
msgstr "кайманы для небесных строителей II"

#. ja: イシュガルド復興向けの魚類資源<br>[イシュガルド復興事業専用]<br>※このアイテムは魚類図鑑には記録されません。
#. de: Eine amphibische Kreatur für den Wieder<shy>aufbau der Himmelsstadt. (Für Aufträge des Wieder<shy>aufbaus Ishgards.)<br>Nicht im Fischverzeichnis vorhanden.
#. fr: Une ressource halieutique destinée au chantier d'Azurée.<br>[Réservé à la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Ishgard]<br>[Non répertorié dans la nomenclature]
#. column 0: grade 2 skybuilders' caiman
#. column 2: grade 2 skybuilders' caimans
#. column 9: Grade 2 Skybuilders' Caiman
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:30001:0:8"
msgid "Though the skybuilders are often willing to take in scalekin captured alive, they have specifically requested that any caiman presented be certifiably dead before being brought to the Firmament. Given its resemblance to a wingless dragon, the less sensible members of the populace may fear a second Dragonsong War is upon them.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide."
msgstr "Небесные строители обычно принимают чешуйчатых, даже если те пойманы живьём. Но каймана они просят доставлять в Твёрдь только после того, как его смерть будет удостоверена. Он похож на бескрылого дракона, и менее сообразительные жители могут решить, что вот-вот начнётся новая Драконья песнь.<br><br>※Не занесён в Справочник рыб."

