#. fr: Une ressource halieutique destinée au chantier d'Azurée.<br>[Réservé à la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Ishgard]<br>[Non répertorié dans la nomenclature]
#. column 0: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' gobbie mask
#. column 2: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' gobbie masks
#. column 9: Grade 2 Artisanal Skybuilders' Gobbie Mask
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:30007:0:8"
msgid "According to some sources, several attempts have been made by goblins to convert the carcasses of these cephalopods into masks. Unfortunately, the retch-inducing stench is too much for most to bear, especially when in such close proximity to the face.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide."
msgstr "Говорят, гоблины не раз пытались делать маски из туш этих головоногих. Но от их тошнотворной вони мало кто может устоять, особенно когда маска оказывается прямо у лица.<br><br>※Не занесён в Справочник рыб."

#. ja: 第二次復興用の特注ゴブリパス
#. de: Genist-Goblinmaske
#. fr: Poulpe gobelin sur commande de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 0: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' gobbie mask
#. column 2: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' gobbie masks
#. column 8: According to some sources, several attempts have been made by goblins to convert the carcasses of these cephalopods into masks. Unfortunately, the retch-inducing stench is too much for most to bear, especially when in such close proximity to the face.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
msgctxt "Item:30007:0:9"
msgid "Grade 2 Artisanal Skybuilders' Gobbie Mask"
msgstr "Ремесленная маска гобби для небесных строителей II"

#. ja: 第二次復興用の特注プテロダクティルス
#. de: Genist-Pterodaktylus
#. fr: ptérodactyle sur commande de restauration (2e phase)
#. column 2: grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' pterodactyls
#. column 8: One must take great care when attempting to catch one of these winged scalekin, as they may find themselves lifted from the ground. In such cases, it is normally best to let go of the rod, although the more absent-minded may find themselves clinging on for dear life for reasons that even they cannot comprehend.<br><br>※Not included in the fish guide.
#. column 9: Grade 2 Artisanal Skybuilders' Pterodactyl
msgctxt "Item:30008:0:0"
msgid "grade 2 artisanal skybuilders' pterodactyl"
msgstr "ремесленный птеродактиль для небесных строителей II"

