#. ja: ディアデム・ガガンボ
#. de: Diadem-Riesenschnake
#. fr: tipule géante du Diadème
#. column 2: Diadem crane flies
#. column 8: The veined wings and spindly legs of the crane fly will attract a plethora of skyborne predators in no time. Presumably some part of this situation is desirable to you. Live bait for skyfishing.<br><br>※Only for use in the Diadem.
#. column 9: Diadem Crane Fly
msgctxt "Item:30280:0:0"
msgid "Diadem crane fly"
msgstr "Комар-долгоножка Диадемы"

