#. ja: 人形の古銭
#. de: Puppen-Münze
#. fr: pièce rouillée des Pantins
#. column 2: puppet's coins
#. column 8: An imitative currency discovered within the Puppets' Bunker. Once considered to be of great historical significance, a sudden influx caused their value to plummet, rendering them almost worthless.
#. column 9: Puppet's Coin
msgctxt "Item:30714:0:0"
msgid "puppet's coin"
msgstr "Монета марионеток"

#. de: Puppen-Münzen
#. fr: pièces rouillées des Pantins
#. column 0: puppet's coin
#. column 8: An imitative currency discovered within the Puppets' Bunker. Once considered to be of great historical significance, a sudden influx caused their value to plummet, rendering them almost worthless.
#. column 9: Puppet's Coin
msgctxt "Item:30714:0:2"
msgid "puppet's coins"
msgstr "Монеты марионеток"

#. ja: 人形タチノ軍事基地で発見された古銭。<br>かつて熱心に収集する好事家がいたが流行は過ぎ去り、今や取引する者はいない
#. de: Eine kleine Münze aus einem merkwürdigen Metall, geborgen aus den ominösen Windungen der Puppenfestung. Einst rissen sich Sammler förmlich um diese Rarität, doch heutzuztage findet man kaum noch Abnehmer.
#. fr: Une vieille pièce de monnaie trouvée dans la base militaire des Pantins. Même si les col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs se les arrachaient autrefois, elles ont depuis perdu en popularité, et plus personne ne les rachète.
#. column 0: puppet's coin
#. column 2: puppet's coins
#. column 9: Puppet's Coin
msgctxt "Item:30714:0:8"
msgid "An imitative currency discovered within the Puppets' Bunker. Once considered to be of great historical significance, a sudden influx caused their value to plummet, rendering them almost worthless."
msgstr "Поддельная монета, найденная в Бункере марионеток. Когда-то её считали важной исторической находкой, но потом таких монет стало слишком много и они почти обесценились."

